83485136_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pTGBWyggOwwQ7kNvwFih-Bc&_nc_oc=AdrHDvQ16eEsCj5ik1QFE25gFUtwBw8OdK-GzbNb--2kNyoe9AVBk6u5UuKIqthzbh8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6oVnKZQWJMautbjxBmPy6iTVQvrnRI3pRF6GoCJqAlaQ&oe=6A119899"}, {"file_name": "ecocardio-Screenshot-005.png", "id": "590596830460245", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391890_590596833793578_6307124770371399137_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9jIO1KcM1wIQ7kNvwEcNLy9&_nc_oc=Adr-6JJDm41FaMSWA9oJJ3lDl8ndmi4JtTpqJDrCU5-xk95RmyntuY0QXFxUkvrN-Rk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6xRT-CsOVscm0nFrvkQhhphHVpW_riSBmS4Ukkh6ycPQ&oe=6A11B2CB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Echocardiography VR - VML", "keywords": ["Echography", "POCUS", "Medical", "Ultrasound", "Healthcare"], "long_description": "**Echocardiography VR**, by VML, is a virtual reality simulation that transforms how medical students and healthcare professionals learn cardiac ultrasound.\n\nStep into a simulation room where you'll master transducer positioning, orientation, and anatomical recognition through hands-on practice. Place the probe on your virtual patient, adjust it to find the correct windows, and activate **X-ray mode** to see how your transducer intersects the heart in real-time.\n\nThe machine offers three learning modes:\n- **2D Mode**: real echocardiography footage as you scan\n- **Freeze Mode**: anatomical illustrations where you identify each structure\n- **3D Mode**: slice through an interactive heart with a special probe and switch to ultrasound-style materials\n\n**Egbot**, your android guide, walks you through a complete tutorial to get the most out of each mode.\n\nWhether you're a student or healthcare professional, this simulation gives you a safe environment to build confidence before scanning real patients!", "short_description": "Improve your echocardiography skills with this immersive VR simulation! Step into the operating room to scan your virtual patient. Learn to identify different cardiac structures through interactive visualizations: see through the chest as if using X-rays, dissect a 3D heart to understand each structure, and more. All guided by Egbot, your virtual tutor."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Cover Landscape_FULL_ES.png", "id": "2558894087837590", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822968_2558894094504256_5404181423913633795_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p9xqgjhKxx8Q7kNvwFlY-iO&_nc_oc=AdoDtlIoBAoV7dKRaTQeLiTnr_tpA76OqVUlUvFGmhTgyccOB7inJLZfNh6OgiqBu68&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6HajA0-StycbWErIBg5oXesuFZ-3UxAqUHyKOul5eLIg&oe=6A11AE6E"}, {"file_name": "Cover Landscape_FULL_ES.png", "id": "1971181917156082", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830888_1971181920489415_1647681755962022117_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LDqr8xTqihsQ7kNvwH58nE1&_nc_oc=Ado9V_8I_QucpaUXnwnEX2FM1OJRvJQv6QBwSZCr9ThttIO0zyPqSeV0pvqD5vTWt4o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5j97VKRHfhdMaIaLdtJP6o9-NJt7uB5klsU64DUUarkQ&oe=6A11A4E9"}, {"file_name": "Cover Square_FULL_ES-1.png", "id": "1912394656053179", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823893_1912394659386512_7066665920184004452_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mCxyxEnPqiAQ7kNvwFSMMKi&_nc_oc=Adrp3vk3CxW1tlw6ciawuYAmwm0lRFOGR-IiTRl-SRHEwAOIZ4xQYmSShzMH4RYT9lw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5WC7XcvgigRN0CtBBfv7dT00bSN7F2PE3qCBwEVkIYig&oe=6A11B5CC"}, {"file_name": "Cover Portrait_FULL_ES.png", "id": "1822870681733204", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827703_1822870685066537_4560401566713579284_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZtNP4Mfg9OwQ7kNvwFbTXeD&_nc_oc=Adrr8YT1xsVhvQYP6w7dOByE3AHgR4zjNEIzJnxnqQEl--12zLi_qFRSGZ_I2WKHX14&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7wr0qmM2oJuIofYiVsqLQt6y6GnYMV1-3G9q0FTmQ7Lg&oe=6A11BD2C"}, {"file_name": "ECHO-DEMO-SQUARE-3.png", "id": "1465068948371145", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827725_1465068951704478_8306382549700619272_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZZ6wvWsK0e8Q7kNvwFT915F&_nc_oc=AdppnxztMoftan8UXUw3kk_AQGu4peZKQKxLf4uS7bbzU9wOtnbpbbmKvkiX7VkqRlg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af79EuJYEOeYwDNgOCuigMjlo4Q_rGIA7XSSeVEW0qw36w&oe=6A11AE46"}]}, "id": "1234561742089673", "locale": "es_LA", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ecocardiograf\u00eda VR - VML", "keywords": ["Medicina", "Ultrasonido", "POCUS", "Ecografia", "Salud"], "long_description": "**Ecocardiograf\u00eda VR**, de VML, es una simulaci\u00f3n de realidad virtual que transforma c\u00f3mo estudiantes de medicina y profesionales de la salud aprenden ultrasonido card\u00edaco.\n\nEntra a una sala de simulaci\u00f3n donde dominar\u00e1s el posicionamiento del transductor, su orientaci\u00f3n y el reconocimiento anat\u00f3mico mediante pr\u00e1ctica activa. Coloca la sonda en tu paciente virtual, aj\u00fastala para encontrar las ventanas correctas, y activa el **modo rayos X** para ver c\u00f3mo tu transductor intersecta el coraz\u00f3n en tiempo real.\n\nLa m\u00e1quina ofrece tres modos de aprendizaje:\n- **Modo 2D**: videos reales de ecocardiograf\u00eda mientras escaneas\n- **Modo Congelado**: ilustraciones anat\u00f3micas donde identificas cada estructura\n- **Modo 3D**: corta un coraz\u00f3n interactivo con una sonda especial y cambia a materiales estilo ultrasonido\n\n**Egbot**, tu gu\u00eda androide, te acompa\u00f1a con un tutorial completo para aprovechar cada modo.\n\nYa seas estudiante o profesional de la salud, esta simulaci\u00f3n te da un ambiente seguro para ganar confianza antes de escanear pacientes reales.", "short_description": "Mejora tus habilidades de ecocardiograf\u00eda con esta simulaci\u00f3n inmersiva en VR. Ad\u00e9ntrate al quir\u00f3fano para escanear a tu paciente virtual con videos reales de ultrasonido, y aprende a identificar las estructuras card\u00edacas mediante visualizaciones interactivas: ve a trav\u00e9s del t\u00f3rax como si usaras rayos X, disecciona un coraz\u00f3n 3D, y m\u00e1s. Todo esto guiado por Egbot, tu tutor virtual."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vml.solutions/privacy-echocardiography-vr-vml", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Virtual Medical Learning", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vml.solutions/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "478089301798119"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["es_MX", "en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26816677961307902"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "933036372544152"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "933036372544152"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1778171280, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "933036372544152"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_